WEBVTT

00:02.500 --> 00:10.000
You drive slow through the orange groves,
wave at people, like you're supposed to be there.

00:10.500 --> 00:17.000
You pass the guard tower, but you're
far enough away they can't see you.

00:17.500 --> 00:22.000
Then you get to the cane fields.
That's where you disappear.

00:22.500 --> 00:34.500
In the cane, nobody can see you. You just
keep driving, following the rows.

00:35.500 --> 00:39.800
The sky changes, gets dark, stars come out.

00:39.800 --> 00:46.500
They were there all along, just waiting
for it to get dark enough to see them.

00:47.500 --> 00:56.500
That's how my dad did it, at the farm,
the other prison.

00:57.500 --> 01:05.000
That's why they moved him here, the Rock.
Because you can't get out of the Rock.

01:05.500 --> 01:08.940
That's what they say.
